{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115642","id":3228602176,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7AcI9A","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115642","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115642.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115642.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115642","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115642/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115642/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115642/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/e011c85cdfab6ba6e336fcdc614dc4ce32420bd7","number":115642,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Optimize animated sprite and tree signals","user":{"login":"Mrfanta-stick","id":105064999,"node_id":"U_kgDOBkMqJw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105064999?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mrfanta-stick","html_url":"https://github.com/Mrfanta-stick","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mrfanta-stick/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mrfanta-stick/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mrfanta-stick/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mrfanta-stick/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mrfanta-stick/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mrfanta-stick/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mrfanta-stick/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mrfanta-stick/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mrfanta-stick/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"### Summary\r\nThis PR optimizes signal emission in `AnimatedSprite2D`, `AnimatedSprite3D`, and `Tree` by replacing raw string literals with `SNAME()` and `SceneStringName()`.\r\n\r\n### Changes\r\n1.  **AnimatedSprite3D (`scene/3d/sprite_3d.cpp`):**\r\n    * Replaced raw `\"animation_looped\"` with `SNAME(\"animation_looped\")` inside `NOTIFICATION_INTERNAL_PROCESS`.\r\n    * **Benchmark:** Synthetic testing (100k emissions) showed a **~2.3x speedup** (reduced overhead from ~14.7ms to ~6.3ms).\r\n2.  **AnimatedSprite2D (`scene/2d/animated_sprite_2d.cpp`):**\r\n    * Applied the same `SNAME` optimization to the 2D equivalent of the `animation_looped` signal for consistency and performance.\r\n3.  **Tree (`scene/gui/tree.cpp`):**\r\n    * Replaced raw `\"button_clicked\"` with `SNAME(\"button_clicked\")` to match the existing `SNAME` usage for other signals in the file (e.g., `multi_selected`).\r\n\r\n### Motivation\r\nThese are \"Hot Path\" optimizations (for the Sprites) and consistency fixes (for the Tree) that reduce static memory duplication and avoid runtime string hashing.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666705648,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA1NjQ4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:animation","name":"topic:animation","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"a